{"seq":1,"slug":"nextjs-app-router","title":"Next.js App Router 深度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-server-components-ssr/frameworks/nextjs-app-router","wordCount":1097,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"next-js-app-router-深度\">Next.js App Router 深度</h1><p>2026 年中，Next.js 16.2 是生产环境的推荐版本。App Router 已完全取代 Pages Router 成为默认架构——Server Components 是所有组件的默认执行模式，Turbopack 是默认构建器，<code>cacheComponents</code> 配置统一了此前分散的 PPR / <code>use cache</code> / <code>dynamicIO</code> 实验标志。本篇不是入门教程，而是深入 App Router 在 2026 年的运行时行为、缓存模型、以及生产环境的关键配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Next.js 16 的 App Router 是 RSC 架构最完整的工业落地：Server Components 是默认执行模式，<code>cacheComponents</code> 统一了 PPR、<code>use cache</code> 与 <code>dynamicIO</code>。其缓存哲学是<strong>默认动态、显式缓存</strong>——<code>fetch()</code> 默认 <code>no-store</code>，开发者用 <code>use cache</code> 指令和 <code>cacheLife</code> 语义化策略按组件/函数级 opt-in。运行时层面，PPR 把路由拆为构建时静态壳与请求时动态流，Streaming Metadata 让元数据解析不再阻塞 TTFB，<code>&lt;Activity&gt;</code> 在客户端导航时保留路由状态，<code>after()</code> 在响应流关闭后执行收尾工作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渲染模型-默认动态-显式缓存\">渲染模型：默认动态，显式缓存</h2><p>Next.js 16 彻底反转了 Next.js 14 的缓存默认行为。此前 <code>fetch()</code> 默认缓存导致了大量&quot;数据为何不更新&quot;的困惑；现在<strong>数据获取默认动态</strong>，开发者通过 <code>use cache</code> 指令显式 opt-in 缓存。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// next.config.ts — 启用 Cache Components（包含 PPR）&#10;import type { NextConfig } from &#39;next&#39;;&#10;&#10;const nextConfig: NextConfig = {&#10;  cacheComponents: true, // 统一开关：PPR + use cache + dynamicIO&#10;};&#10;&#10;export default nextConfig;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// next.config.ts — 启用 Cache Components（包含 PPR）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { NextConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'next'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nextConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NextConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cacheComponents: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 统一开关：PPR + use cache + dynamicIO</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nextConfig;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>版本</th>\n<th><code>fetch()</code> 默认</th>\n<th>路由段默认</th>\n<th>缓存 opt-in 方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Next.js 14</td>\n<td><code>force-cache</code></td>\n<td>尽量静态</td>\n<td><code>no-store</code> / <code>revalidate: 0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Next.js 15</td>\n<td><code>no-store</code></td>\n<td>动态</td>\n<td><code>cache: &#39;force-cache&#39;</code> / <code>revalidate: N</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Next.js 16</td>\n<td><code>no-store</code></td>\n<td>动态</td>\n<td><code>&#39;use cache&#39;</code> 指令（组件/函数级）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"use-cache-指令\"><code>use cache</code> 指令</h2><p><code>use cache</code> 是 Next.js 16 引入的新指令（类似 <code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 和 <code>&#39;use server&#39;</code>），声明一个组件或函数的输出应被缓存：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 组件级缓存&#10;async function ProductDescription({ id }: { id: string }) {&#10;  &#39;use cache&#39;;&#10;  const product = await db.products.findById(id);&#10;  return &lt;p&gt;{product.description}&lt;/p&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 函数级缓存&#10;async function getGlobalConfig() {&#10;  &#39;use cache&#39;;&#10;  return await db.config.findFirst();&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 搭配 cacheLife 控制过期策略&#10;import { cacheLife } from &#39;next/cache&#39;;&#10;&#10;async function PricingSection({ productId }: { productId: string }) {&#10;  &#39;use cache&#39;;&#10;  cacheLife(&#39;minutes&#39;); // 预定义策略：分钟级过期&#10;  const price = await fetchPrice(productId);&#10;  return &lt;span className=&quot;price&quot;&gt;{price}&lt;/span&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 组件级缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProductDescription</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'use cache'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> product</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.products.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{product.description}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 函数级缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getGlobalConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'use cache'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.config.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findFirst</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 搭配 cacheLife 控制过期策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { cacheLife } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'next/cache'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PricingSection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">productId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">productId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'use cache'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  cacheLife</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'minutes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 预定义策略：分钟级过期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> price</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchPrice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(productId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">span</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> className</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{price}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">span</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>cacheLife</code> 提供语义化的过期策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略名</th>\n<th>stale</th>\n<th>revalidate</th>\n<th>expire</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>&#39;seconds&#39;</code></td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1s</td>\n<td>60s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&#39;minutes&#39;</code></td>\n<td>5min</td>\n<td>1min</td>\n<td>1h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&#39;hours&#39;</code></td>\n<td>5min</td>\n<td>1h</td>\n<td>1d</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&#39;days&#39;</code></td>\n<td>5min</td>\n<td>1d</td>\n<td>1w</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&#39;weeks&#39;</code></td>\n<td>5min</td>\n<td>1w</td>\n<td>30d</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&#39;max&#39;</code></td>\n<td>5min</td>\n<td>30d</td>\n<td>1y</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"partial-prerendering-ppr\">Partial Prerendering（PPR）</h2><p>PPR 是 <code>cacheComponents</code> 启用后的默认渲染行为。它将每个路由拆分为<strong>构建时静态壳</strong>和<strong>请求时动态流</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 构建时&#10;        A[Next.js Build] --&gt; B[渲染组件树]&#10;        B --&gt; C{遇到 Suspense 边界?}&#10;        C --&gt;|外部| D[生成静态 HTML Shell]&#10;        C --&gt;|内部| E[标记为动态占位符]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 请求时&#10;        F[CDN 立即返回静态 Shell] --&gt; G[同时服务器开始渲染动态部分]&#10;        G --&gt; H[流式注入 Suspense 内容]&#10;    end&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; G\">graph TB\n    subgraph 构建时\n        A[Next.js Build] --&gt; B[渲染组件树]\n        B --&gt; C{遇到 Suspense 边界?}\n        C --&gt;|外部| D[生成静态 HTML Shell]\n        C --&gt;|内部| E[标记为动态占位符]\n    end\n    subgraph 请求时\n        F[CDN 立即返回静态 Shell] --&gt; G[同时服务器开始渲染动态部分]\n        G --&gt; H[流式注入 Suspense 内容]\n    end\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; G</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// app/product/[id]/page.tsx — PPR 示例&#10;import { Suspense } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default async function ProductPage({ params }) {&#10;  const { id } = await params;&#10;  const product = await getProduct(id); // 构建时获取（如果启用 use cache）&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;main&gt;&#10;      {/* 静态壳：构建时渲染 */}&#10;      &lt;h1&gt;{product.name}&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;      &lt;img src={product.image} alt={product.name} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;p&gt;{product.description}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;      {/* 动态区域：请求时流式注入 */}&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;PriceSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;LivePrice productId={id} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;ReviewsSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;UserReviews productId={id} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;    &lt;/main&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/product/[id]/page.tsx — PPR 示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Suspense } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProductPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> params;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> product</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getProduct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 构建时获取（如果启用 use cache）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 静态壳：构建时渲染 */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{product.name}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">img src</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{product.image} alt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{product.name} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E