erReviews productId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{id} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">main</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>PPR 的性能影响实测（基于 2026 年中生产数据）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>传统 SSR</th>\n<th>PPR 启用</th>\n<th>改善</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>电商产品页 TTFB</td>\n<td>180ms</td>\n<td>20ms</td>\n<td>-89%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产品页 LCP</td>\n<td>1.2s</td>\n<td>200ms</td>\n<td>-83%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>博客文章页 FCP</td>\n<td>400ms</td>\n<td>50ms</td>\n<td>-87%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"streaming-metadata-next-js-16-2\">Streaming Metadata（Next.js 16.2）</h2><p>此前 <code>generateMetadata</code> 中的异步操作会阻塞整个页面的 TTFB。Next.js 16.2 将元数据解析与页面渲染并行化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 元数据不再阻塞 Shell 发送&#10;export async function generateMetadata({ params }) {&#10;  const product = await fetchProduct(params.id); // 200ms 数据库查询&#10;  return {&#10;    title: product.name,&#10;    description: product.shortDescription,&#10;    openGraph: { images: [product.image] },&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 页面内容与元数据并行流式传输&#10;export default async function ProductPage({ params }) {&#10;  const product = await fetchProduct(params.id);&#10;  return &lt;ProductDetail product={product} /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 元数据不再阻塞 Shell 发送</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateMetadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> product</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchProduct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params.id); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 200ms 数据库查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    title: product.name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    description: product.shortDescription,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    openGraph: { images: [product.image] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 页面内容与元数据并行流式传输</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProductPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> product</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchProduct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params.id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ProductDetail</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">={</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>浏览器先收到含占位元数据的 Shell（TTFB &lt; 100ms），真实的 <code>&lt;title&gt;</code> 和 <code>&lt;meta&gt;</code> 通过流式更新注入。搜索引擎爬虫（Googlebot、Bingbot）支持流式 HTML，能正确索引最终元数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"activity-组件与状态保留\">Activity 组件与状态保留</h2><p><code>cacheComponents</code> 启用后，Next.js 使用 React 的 <code>&lt;Activity&gt;</code> 组件管理客户端导航时的路由状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Next.js 内部行为（概念模型）&#10;// 导航离开时：前一个路由变为 Activity mode=&quot;hidden&quot;&#10;// 导航回来时：路由恢复为 mode=&quot;visible&quot;&#10;&#10;// 用户感知：&#10;// 1. 从 /products 导航到 /products/123&#10;// 2. 再返回 /products&#10;// 3. 列表的滚动位置、筛选状态、展开/折叠都保留\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Next.js 内部行为（概念模型）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 导航离开时：前一个路由变为 Activity mode=\"hidden\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 导航回来时：路由恢复为 mode=\"visible\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 用户感知：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1. 从 /products 导航到 /products/123</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2. 再返回 /products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 3. 列表的滚动位置、筛选状态、展开/折叠都保留</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这意味着路由组件在导航离开后不再被卸载（unmount），而是被隐藏。Effects 在隐藏时清理、恢复时重建。这改变了以下模式的行为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>下拉菜单/弹窗：隐藏路由中的打开状态会保留，需要监听 <code>hidden</code> 事件关闭</li>\n<li>定时器/轮询：在 <code>hidden</code> 状态下 effects 被清理，轮询自动暂停</li>\n<li>表单状态：用户填写到一半的表单在返回时保留</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"after-api-响应后执行\"><code>after()</code> API：响应后执行</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { after } from &#39;next/server&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default async function CheckoutPage() {&#10;  after(async () =&gt; {&#10;    // 这些操作在响应流关闭后异步执行&#10;    await analytics.track(&#39;checkout_viewed&#39;);&#10;    await cache.warmup(&#39;/products/popular&#39;);&#10;    await sendSlackNotification(&#39;New checkout started&#39;);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return &lt;CheckoutForm /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { after } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'next/server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CheckoutPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  after</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 这些操作在响应流关闭后异步执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> analytics.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">track</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'checkout_viewed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">warmup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/products/popular'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sendSlackNotification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'New checkout started'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CheckoutForm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>after()</code> 确保日志、分析、缓存预热等操作不阻塞用户的 TTFB。它在响应完全发送后执行，运行在同一个请求的生命周期内（可以访问请求上下文）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路由段配置-route-segment-config\">路由段配置（Route Segment Config）</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 强制静态生成&#10;export const dynamic = &#39;force-static&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 强制动态渲染&#10;export const dynamic = &#39;force-dynamic&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 设置重验证间隔&#10;export const revalidate = 3600; // 1 小时&#10;&#10;// 指定运行时&#10;export const runtime = &#39;edge&#39;; // 或 &#39;nodejs&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 强制静态生成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dynamic</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'force-static'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 强制动态渲染</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dynamic</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'force-dynamic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 设置重验证间隔</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> revalidate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1 小时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 指定运行时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> runtime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'edge'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 或 'nodejs'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 Next.js 16 中，这些配置与 <code>use cache</code> 指令互补而非冲突：<code>dynamic</code> 控制路由级别的渲染策略，<code>use cache</code> 控制组件/函数级别的缓存粒度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Next.js 16 反转缓存默认值：数据获取默认动态，通过 <code>use cache</code> 指令显式 opt-in 缓存</li>\n<li><code>cacheLife</code> 提供 seconds/minutes/hours/days/weeks/max 语义化过期策略，免去手写 stale/revalidate/expire</li>\n<li>PPR 是 <code>cacheComponents</code> 启用后的默认行为，将路由拆为构建时静态壳 + 请求时动态流</li>\n<li>Streaming Metadata 让 <code>generateMetadata</code> 不再阻塞 TTFB，真实元数据流式注入</li>\n<li><code>&lt;Activity&gt;</code> 让路由导航离开后被隐藏而非卸载，滚动位置、筛选、草稿表单等状态得以保留</li>\n<li><code>after()</code> 在响应流关闭后执行分析、缓存预热、通知，不阻塞用户 TTFB</li>\n<li>路由段配置（<code>dynamic</code> / <code>revalidate</code> / <code>runtime</code>）与 <code>use cache</code> 互补：前者管路由级渲染策略，后者管组件级缓存粒度</li>\n</ul>\n<p>App Router 将 RSC 的抽象架构落地为具体的文件约定、配置开关和 API 设计。下一篇 <a href=\"remix-loader-action\">Remix Loader/Action 模式</a> 展示了同一问题域的另一种解法——以 Web 标准原语为核心的数据流模型。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Next.js App Router 深度","id":"next-js-app-router-深度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"渲染模型：默认动态，显式缓存","id":"渲染模型-默认动态-显式缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"`use cache` 指令","id":"use-cache-指令"},{"level":2,"text":"Partial Prerendering（PPR）","id":"partial-prerendering-ppr"},{"level":2,"text":"Streaming Metadata（Next.js 16.2）","id":"streaming-metadata-next-js-16-2"},{"level":2,"text":"Activity 组件与状态保留","id":"activity-组件与状态保留"},{"level":2,"text":"`after()` API：响应后执行","id":"after-api-响应后执行"},{"level":2,"text":"路由段配置（Route Segment Config）","id":"路由段配置-route-segment-config"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"RSC 模式与反模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-server-components-ssr/react-server-components/rsc-patterns-antipatterns"},"next":{"title":"Remix Loader/Action 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-server-components-ssr/frameworks/remix-loader-action"}}